From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: computerguy526 <355510486+computerguy526@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 21:37:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] kosmickrisp: render pass load/store statistics, pass merge,
 encoder barrier and load diagnostics

KK_RP_STATS=<s>: per period the renderings, Metal render encoders and the
attachment bytes behind each load and store action.

KK_RP_MERGE=1: vkCmdEndRendering keeps the render encoder open; the next
vkCmdBeginRendering of the command buffer continues it when it targets the
same attachments (clears become clear draws), so nothing is stored and
loaded in between. A barrier in between is judged like a barrier inside
the rendering; compute, copies, labels, timestamps and the end of the
command buffer close the encoder first.

KK_NARROW_ENCODER_BARRIER=1: the barrier at the end of a render encoder
does not hold back the vertex/object/mesh stages of later encoders.

KK_RP_NOLOAD_DIAG=1: diagnostic only, LOAD becomes DONT_CARE.

KK_RP_LIVE_FILE=<path> (merge=0|1 narrow=0|1 noload=0|1) switches them at
run time. All off by default: the driver then records the same Metal
commands as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
